<content><![CDATA[<p>Bake detail from a high-poly sculpt onto a low-poly, game-ready mesh using normal and ambient occlusion maps.</p>
<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>
<ol>
<li>Prepare high- and low-poly meshes for baking</li>
<li>Set up a cage and bake normal and ambient occlusion maps</li>
<li>Diagnose and fix common baking artifacts</li>
</ol>
